<Legal
  title="Privacy Policy | Adelaide Airport to Barossa"
  description="How Adelaide Airport to Barossa collects, uses and stores the personal information you give us when you request a transfer."
  slug="privacy"
  h1="Privacy Policy"
  updated="25 July 2026"
>
  <p>This policy explains what we do with the personal information you give us when you request an
    airport transfer or a Barossa day tour through this website. We handle your information in line
    with the Australian Privacy Principles under the <em>Privacy Act 1988</em> (Cth).</p>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <p>When you lodge a booking request we collect only what we need to quote and run your trip:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>your name;</li>
    <li>your email address and phone number;</li>
    <li>your flight number and arrival date, if you give them;</li>
    <li>passenger numbers and your drop-off point;</li>
    <li>anything else you choose to tell us in your message, such as child-seat or luggage needs.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We do not collect payment card details through this website.</p>

  <h2>How we use it</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To reply with a flat fare and confirm your booking.</li>
    <li>To track your flight so your driver meets the actual arrival time.</li>
    <li>To contact you about that booking, including on the day of travel.</li>
    <li>To keep a record of the job for tax and insurance purposes.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We do not sell your information, and we do not add you to a marketing list from a booking
    request.</p>

  <h2>Who else sees it</h2>
  <p>Your request is delivered to our business inbox by email. To do that we use:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Cloudflare</strong>, which hosts this website and processes the form submission;</li>
    <li><strong>SMTP2GO</strong>, which delivers the notification and confirmation emails;</li>
    <li><strong>Microsoft Outlook</strong>, where our business mailbox is held.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>These providers may store data outside Australia. We share your details with a driver only so
    far as they need them to complete your trip, and we disclose information to anyone else only
    where the law requires it.</p>

  <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
  <p>This website sets no advertising or tracking cookies. Fonts are loaded from Google Fonts, which
    receives your IP address as part of that request. If we add analytics later, this policy will be
    updated before that happens.</p>

  <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
  <p>Booking correspondence is kept for as long as we need it for the trip and for our tax and
    insurance records, generally seven years, then deleted.</p>

  <h2>Access, correction and complaints</h2>
  <p>You can ask us for a copy of the information we hold about you, ask us to correct it, or ask us
    to delete it where we are not required to keep it. Email
    <a href="mailto:barossacabs@outlook.com.au">barossacabs@outlook.com.au</a> or call
    <a href="tel:+61447958346">0447 958 346</a> and we will respond within a reasonable time.</p>
  <p>If you are not satisfied with our response, you can contact the Office of the Australian
    Information Commissioner at <a href="https://www.oaic.gov.au" rel="noopener">oaic.gov.au</a>.</p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>If this policy changes we will publish the new version on this page and update the date above.</p>
</Legal>
